    <code code="29545-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Physical findings note"/>
    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-04-15; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Comfortable; temperature 37.4 °C, pulse 88, blood pressure 126/80</td></tr><tr><td>Face and neck</td><td>Mild left cheek swelling; a small tender left submandibular node; no neck swelling; mouth opens three finger-breadths</td></tr><tr><td>Mouth</td><td>Fluctuant buccal vestibular swelling beside tooth 19, which is fractured, carious and tender to percussion; floor of mouth soft; generalized gum inflammation with calculus, bleeding on probing and probing depths of 5 to 7 mm at the molars</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
